I didn't realize the meaning it would have for me until now.  Just a stupid night in…]]></description><link>https://gatsbystarterblogsource.gatsbyjs.io/2024-11-09-little-prince/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://gatsbystarterblogsource.gatsbyjs.io/2024-11-09-little-prince/</guid><pubDate>Sat, 09 Nov 2024 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><content:encoded>&lt;p&gt;I edited this video over a year ago. Never posted it.
I didn&apos;t realize the meaning it would have for me until now.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;gatsby-resp-iframe-wrapper&quot; style=&quot;padding-bottom: 177.75%; position: relative; height: 0; overflow: hidden; margin-bottom: 1.0725rem&quot; &gt; &lt;div class=&quot;embedVideo-container&quot;&gt; &lt;iframe title=&quot;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/8Xhc4Mn924U?rel=0&quot; class=&quot;embedVideo-iframe&quot; style=&quot;border:0; position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; &quot; loading=&quot;lazy&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; sandbox=&quot;allow-same-origin allow-scripts allow-popups&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;/div&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Just a stupid night in our living room. We were treating our bedroom for ants and couldn&apos;t stay in there. Rena thought it was going to be a bad night, so I setup a &quot;fort&quot; and had a sleepover with the dogs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I still felt like a child back then. Just drifting along. So much changed in just a couple years. I had &quot;five year plans&quot; that feel so tenuous now.
Careers. Money. None of that shit even matters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The best thing in life is coming home to your dog, all excited to see you, and going on a walk with them. Maybe there&apos;s even a cool breeeze.&lt;/p&gt;</content:encoded></item><item><title><![CDATA[2023 Retrospective]]></title><description><![CDATA[I was going through photos to create a collage of memories. But there was a strong theme among the photos that resonated with me.  There's a…]]></description><link>https://gatsbystarterblogsource.gatsbyjs.io/2024-01-03-retrospective/</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://gatsbystarterblogsource.gatsbyjs.io/2024-01-03-retrospective/</guid><pubDate>Wed, 03 Jan 2024 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><content:encoded>&lt;p&gt;I was going through photos to create a collage of memories. But there was a strong theme among the photos that resonated with me.&lt;/p&gt;
